200&h=200&blur=200&s=5fcc2907a4305e092c4616046886031a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/068f0844/uploads/origins/dfe953ec-f8cb-4255-ae05-dab0b2c6f100?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5fcc2907a4305e092c4616046886031a, https://si.imgix.net/068f0844/uploads/origins/dfe953ec-f8cb-4255-ae05-dab0b2c6f100?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=30725f0e90587fbbfb13665c487560f4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/068f0844/uploads/origins/dfe953ec-f8cb-4255-ae05-dab0b2c6f100?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=32573b04436fa76871966421e54adc86 3x"}, "body": "I am always happy to visit your distribution. My name is Aonomaki.\nI would like to introduce myself. key visual? I would like to request a standing picture or a key visual of myself.\n\nI am a white rabbit, not so muscular, with blue eyes.\nHis ears are not drooping but pinned.\nClothing is business casual, navy blue with a long scarf. Shoes are boots.\nHis age? is \"arafô,\" but younger is also acceptable.\n\nI would like the beast to hold a stuffed capybara in his arms.\nThe capybara has narrow eyes, or rather, the type with closed eyes often seen in mascots.\nShe is wearing a blue hoodie, apron and cargo pants. You do not need to wear shoes.\nThe capibara is about the size of a stuffed animal up to the knees. It is only plush-like, not a stuffed animal.\nIt's more like my current icon.\nFor reference.\nhttps://x.com/maki_blue415/status/1540741895608864770?s=46&t=Bh9Bgzorz5pvs1Os_4N2HQ\n\nI have no problem with the production scene being played on the distribution.\nIs there anything missing? I hope not.\nBest regards.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kashi_kiduti/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2595503, "client_id": 2695939, "vtt_u